 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "ProductPrice() starts empty. update(timestamp, price) sets the price at timestamp, replacing a previous record there. current() returns the price at the largest recorded timestamp. maximum() and minimum() return the largest and smallest price over the current records (a replaced price no longer counts). Each query returns -1 when nothing is recorded. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
